/* Chinese (Simplified). */

/* AppDelegate */
"Let Picline handle your screenshots?" = "让 Picline 接收系统截图？";
"Screenshots will hang on the line the instant you take them, without the floating thumbnail, and will not pile up on your Desktop. Drag one to a folder to keep it, or discard it with the cross. You can turn this off from the menu bar, and your settings come back when Picline quits." = "开启后，macOS 截图会直接保存到本应用的截图文件夹并挂到绳子上，不再显示系统浮动缩略图，也不会堆积在桌面。拖到文件夹即可保留，点叉可丢弃。此设置仅影响系统截图，不会更改 Shottr 或 Snapzy 的设置；关闭此选项或退出应用后，系统截图设置会恢复。";
